    <item>
      <title>voz 0.0.4-beta.100006</title>
      <description>&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;See your top apps, with their icons, in Insights&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Updates install only while your Mac is idle&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Setup runs again after a fresh install&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;See the time left while a speech model downloads&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Calmer settings and a red dot while you record&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Smoother transcript navigation and consistent menu icons&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Moving Voz to the Trash quits it and removes its login item&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Slow extensions and cleanup can no longer stall dictation or startup&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Voz tells you when microphone access is denied&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;The app includes the licenses of its dependencies&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;</description>
